    {
      "text": "设 $A = \\begin{pmatrix} 3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 3 \\end{pmatrix}$，$B = \\begin{pmatrix} p & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 \\end{pmatrix}$。若 $|AB^{-1}| = \\frac{3}{2}$，求参数 $p$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "含参行列式的计算",
        "行列式应用"
      ],
      "question_type": "含参行列式",
      "method": [
